      "content": "I understand that you’re feeling disillusioned right now. Perhaps consider exploring the beauty inherent in the journey itself, not just the destination. Even if the universe seems indifferent, your story still has the power to inspire and impact others. Rather than perceiving it as a performance for an empty theater, see it as participating in a unique moment in time. Your existence adds to the tapestry of life, however small, and in that, there can be a profound sense of purpose.",
